            "library": "H5P.MultiChoice 1.16",
            "params": {
              "question": "<p>According to the video, what are the three aims of first aid, in the order they were described?</p>",
              "answers": [
                {
                  "text": "<div>Diagnose the underlying condition, prescribe treatment, and refer to a specialist</div>",
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>Diagnosis and prescribing are medical acts beyond first aid's scope. First aid is about immediate, temporary help before professional care arrives, not definitive diagnosis or treatment.</div>",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": "<div>Preserve life, prevent the condition from getting worse, and promote recovery</div>",
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>Correct. These three aims frame everything a first-aider does — keeping the casualty alive, stopping further harm, and supporting healing — all while professional help is on the way.</div>",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": "<div>Stabilise vital signs, administer medication, and arrange transport</div>",
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>First-aiders do not administer medication as part of these core aims. The three aims are preserve life, prevent worsening, and promote recovery.</div>",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": "<div>Assess danger, call for help, and begin compressions</div>",
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>This describes steps within the DRSABC primary assessment, not the three overarching aims of first aid itself.</div>",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  }
                }
              ],
              "overallFeedback": [
                {
                  "from": 0,
                  "to": 50,
                  "feedback": "Not quite. The three aims of first aid are: preserve life, prevent the condition from getting worse, and promote recovery."
                },
                {
                  "from": 51,
                  "to": 100,
                  "feedback": "Correct — preserve life, prevent worsening, promote recovery are the three governing aims of first aid."
                }
              ],
